{"unit_id":"lvzhiyuan0308__dsh_session_delete#feature-1","repo":"lvzhiyuan0308/dsh_session_delete","commit":"314f420589dae11530bb18b10790a13aa35ed43b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh_session_delete 的功能「menu」：在网页侧栏会话的菜单中加入“删除此对话”危险操作。选择后关闭菜单并打开确认弹窗，用户可取消或确认。（见 client.js:13-18）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:13-18"]}
{"unit_id":"lvzhiyuan0308__dsh_session_delete#feature-2","repo":"lvzhiyuan0308/dsh_session_delete","commit":"314f420589dae11530bb18b10790a13aa35ed43b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh_session_delete 的功能「confirm」：显示所选会话标题并要求用户确认删除；操作期间禁用按钮，失败时展示错误，成功后通知会话列表移除条目。（见 client.js:20-57）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:20-57"]}
{"unit_id":"lvzhiyuan0308__dsh_session_delete#feature-3","repo":"lvzhiyuan0308/dsh_session_delete","commit":"314f420589dae11530bb18b10790a13aa35ed43b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh_session_delete 的功能「delete」：服务端确认请求后校验会话 ID 和会话类型，停止会话活动并等待写入释放，然后删除本地会话日志并清理工作区关联。（见 index.js:37-90）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:37-90"]}
{"unit_id":"lvzhiyuan0308__dsh_session_delete#feature-4","repo":"lvzhiyuan0308/dsh_session_delete","commit":"314f420589dae11530bb18b10790a13aa35ed43b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh_session_delete 的功能「guard」：删除流程检查会话仍在运行或有后台活动的情况，并验证会话目录位于配置存储根目录下，异常时返回错误。（见 index.js:57-80）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:57-80"]}
